{"seq":2,"slug":"auto-compensation-trigger-settlement","title":"自动赔付触发与资金结算机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/auto-compensation-carrier-claim/auto-compensation-trigger-settlement","wordCount":2758,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动赔付触发与资金结算机制\">自动赔付触发与资金结算机制</h1><p>超时判定引擎产出「这单晚了 41 小时」之后，系统面对的不是一个指标，而是一笔要真实付出的钱。自动赔付的全部难点在于：谁有资格判定这笔钱该出、出多少、以什么形式出、什么时候真正划走、以及出错后怎么追回。跨境场景再叠一层——赔付的是一种货币，承运商追偿结算的往往是另一种货币，汇率与手续费会悄悄吃掉利润。本文只谈从「超时成立」到「资金落账」这一段闭环的工程机制，判定口径与承诺计算分别见同章的 <a href=\"../lateness-determination/delivery-event-and-lateness-basis\">妥投事件与超时判定口径</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-触发条件是合取式\">核心概念：触发条件是合取式</h2><p>赔付触发不是单一条件，而是一个合取式。判定引擎给出「超时＝真」只满足了第一个子句，剩下的每一个都可能让赔付在放款前被撤回。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>payout</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>late</mtext></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>evidence</mtext></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>eligibility</mtext></msub><mo>∧</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>exemption</mtext></msub><mo>∧</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{payout}} = E_{\\text{late}} \\wedge V_{\\text{evidence}} \\wedge P_{\\text{eligibility}} \\wedge \\neg X_{\\text{exemption}} \\wedge \\neg F_{\\text{fraud}} \\wedge S_{\\text{settled}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">payout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">late</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">evidence</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eligibility</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exemption</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>late</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{late}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">late</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是超时判定结果，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>evidence</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{evidence}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">evidence</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是证据等级达标（通常要求 L1 签收影像或 L2 承运商投递扫描，L3 派送尝试不足以单独定赔），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>eligibility</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{eligibility}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eligibility</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是订单在下单时确属「保证送达」品类，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>exemption</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_{\\text{exemption}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exemption</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是免责集合（不可抗力、买家未提供正确清关信息、买家改约派送、罢工与海关扣留），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fraud</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{fraud}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fraud</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是反欺诈闸门，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{settled}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是支付侧已实际收款。六个子句缺一不可，任何一条未知都应当把赔付推进「挂起」而非默认放行。</p>\n<p>实际工程中最容易出错的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>eligibility</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{eligibility}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eligibility</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>时点绑定</strong>。一份订单在 2026-03 下单时承诺函数判定为「保证送达」，但 2026-05 的规则版本把该目的地品类移出了保障范围——赔付时若用现行规则去判历史订单，会批量错赔或批量漏赔。正确做法是把下单时的规则版本 ID 与承诺快照一起冻结在订单上，赔付时回放当时的版本，这与承诺产品的做法一致（见 <a href=\"../delivery-promise-product/promise-date-computation-model\">承诺日计算模型</a>）。</p>\n<p>六子句里最常被当成「单一条件」误判的三处，值得单独点明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>证据等级</strong>——派送尝试（L3）常被承运商标注为接近妥投，但它只能证明「到过」而非「已交付」，不足以单独定赔。</li>\n<li><strong>免责集合</strong>——不可抗力、买家未提供准确清关信息、买家改约派送、罢工与海关扣留，命中任一条即关闭工单并留存免责原因。</li>\n<li><strong>收款状态</strong>——未完成支付结算的订单即使超时也不能放款，否则赔付变成对欺诈下单的补贴。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;判定引擎: 超时成立&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;证据等级达标?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| H1[&quot;挂起&lt;br/&gt;等待 POD / 人工复核&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{&quot;下单时属保障品类?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| H2[&quot;关闭&lt;br/&gt;非保障订单&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D{&quot;命中免责集合?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| H3[&quot;关闭&lt;br/&gt;记录免责原因&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E{&quot;反欺诈评分通过?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| H4[&quot;挂起&lt;br/&gt;进入风控队列&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F{&quot;支付已收款结算?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H5[&quot;延迟&lt;br/&gt;待收款后重试&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;生成赔付工单&lt;br/&gt;进入资金结算&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"判定引擎: 超时成立\"] --&gt; B{\"证据等级达标?\"}\n    B --&gt;|否| H1[\"挂起&lt;br/&gt;等待 POD / 人工复核\"]\n    B --&gt;|是| C{\"下单时属保障品类?\"}\n    C --&gt;|否| H2[\"关闭&lt;br/&gt;非保障订单\"]\n    C --&gt;|是| D{\"命中免责集合?\"}\n    D --&gt;|是| H3[\"关闭&lt;br/&gt;记录免责原因\"]\n    D --&gt;|否| E{\"反欺诈评分通过?\"}\n    E --&gt;|否| H4[\"挂起&lt;br/&gt;进入风控队列\"]\n    E --&gt;|是| F{\"支付已收款结算?\"}\n    F --&gt;|否| H5[\"延迟&lt;br/&gt;待收款后重试\"]\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"生成赔付工单&lt;br/&gt;进入资金结算\"]</pre><h2 id=\"赔付额度-阶梯-封顶与形式选择\">赔付额度：阶梯、封顶与形式选择</h2><p>额度模型决定「赔多少」，它同时受商业策略与合规约束。行业里三类形态并存，选择本身就是产品决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>赔付形式</th>\n<th>典型规则</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>可核验来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免运费（运费全额退）</td>\n<td>赔付额 = 该单运费</td>\n<td>运费占比高的直邮件</td>\n<td>eBay Guaranteed Delivery 条款，ebay.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定抵扣券（credit）</td>\n<td>封顶如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/</span></span></span></span></span>10，限于本店使用</td>\n<td>低毛利快消，成本可控</td>\n<td>Amazon 卖家自配送迟发退款实践，sellercentral.amazon.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按比例赔付</td>\n<td>赔付额 = 货值 × 迟到档位费率</td>\n<td>高客单价 3C、家电</td>\n<td>各平台缺货/超时赔付政策文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态赔付</td>\n<td>依迟到时长与会员等级浮动</td>\n<td>会员体系深度绑定的平台</td>\n<td>会员权益条款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>固定券模型最流行，因为它的成本是封顶的且能锁定二次消费。它的工程难点在<strong>去重</strong>：同一买家同一订单可能在「超时」「缺货」「商品损坏」三种工单下各触发一次券发放，若不设跨工单互斥锁，会重复发放。常见做法是给「订单 + 权益类型」加唯一键，并把券的生命周期状态（已发放 / 已核销 / 已过期 / 已作废）集中管理，避免过期券被重复计入赔付成本。</p>\n<p>阶梯模型则要把费率表版本化。以三段阶梯为例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Payout</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>item</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0.05</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>24</mn><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0.10</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>72</mn><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0.20</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>72</mn><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Payout} = V_{\\text{item}} \\cdot r(\\Delta t), \\quad r(\\Delta t)=\\begin{cases} 0.05 &amp; 0 &lt; \\Delta t \\le 24\\text{h} \\\\ 0.10 &amp; 24 &lt; \\Delta t \\le 72\\text{h} \\\\ 0.20 &amp; \\Delta t &gt; 72\\text{h} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Payout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">item</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>上限必须存在，否则高货值订单加上长延迟会产出荒谬的赔付额（一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2,000</mn><mtext>的家电晚</mtext><mn>4</mn><mtext>天赔</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2{,}000 的家电晚 4 天赔</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的家电晚</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天赔</span></span></span></span></span>400）。工程上同时对绝对额封顶与货值比例封顶取小值，并把封顶值做成可按国家/品类覆盖的配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资金结算的时序与出账链路\">资金结算的时序与出账链路</h2><p>赔付不是「判定即打款」。一笔赔付工单要经过生成、审批（或按金额阈值自动放行）、出账、收款方入账、对账五个状态，任一状态失败都要有补偿路径。金额阈值化的审批矩阵把人力集中在高风险大额上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>赔付金额档</th>\n<th>审批路径</th>\n<th>到账时效</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≤ 等值 $30</td>\n<td>全自动放行</td>\n<td>实时至 T+1</td>\n<td>体验优先，覆盖 90%+ 工单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30–</span></span></span></span></span>200</td>\n<td>规则引擎自动 + 抽样人工</td>\n<td>T+1 至 T+3</td>\n<td>成本与体验平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; $200</td>\n<td>人工复核</td>\n<td>T+3 起</td>\n<td>防大额错赔</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境资金侧的关键事实是<strong>赔付币种与结算币种常常不同</strong>。买家在德国用 EUR 下单，平台以 USD 记账，承运商追偿以 USD 或承运商本币结算。三处汇率若不在同一时点锁定，就会出现汇兑损益。稳妥做法是：赔付发生时按财务锁定的汇率表（通常每日一次更新，来自中央银行公布的中间价）折算记入准备金，承运商追偿到账时按实际到账金额冲抵，差额单独记入汇兑损益科目，而不是混入赔付成本——否则成本核算会随汇率波动而失真。</p>\n<p>准备金（accrual）是这套机制的财务基石。赔付属于或有负债，必须在超时<strong>可能发生但尚未支付</strong>时就计提，而不是等现金流出的那天才记账。计提金额用期望值法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>accrual</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>in-transit</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>late</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>payout</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{accrual}} = N_{\\text{in-transit}} \\cdot P_{\\text{late}} \\cdot \\bar{P}_{\\text{payout}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accrual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">late</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">payout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>in-transit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{in-transit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是在途可赔订单数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>late</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{late}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">late</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该目的地/承运商组合的历史超时率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>payout</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{P}_{\\text{payout}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">payout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平均赔付额。这个公式让财务在月末能给出可解释的赔付负债，而不是被现金流突变打个措手不及。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承运商追偿-把支出反向传导\">承运商追偿：把支出反向传导</h2><p>有赔付就应有追偿。对时效件与保证服务，承运商在服务条款里承担超时责任，平台可依此发起索赔。追偿不是每单都做——单件索赔的行政成本往往高于赔付额，实务上按批次聚合：把同一承运商、同一服务等级、同一周期的超时订单打包成一份索赔单，附上轨迹证据包。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>承运商 / 服务</th>\n<th>追偿依据</th>\n<th>时效承诺</th>\n<th>索赔时限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UPS 时效件（Next Day Air 等）</td>\n<td>UPS Service Guarantee</td>\n<td>承诺时刻（如 10:30）</td>\n<td>通常 15 天内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FedEx Express</td>\n<td>FedEx Money-Back Guarantee</td>\n<td>承诺日/时刻</td>\n<td>依当期条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DHL Express</td>\n<td>DHL Time Definite 条款</td>\n<td>承诺日</td>\n<td>依当期条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon 合作承运商（Partnered Carrier）</td>\n<td>卖家平台索赔流程</td>\n<td>依服务</td>\n<td>依平台流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USPS Priority Mail Express</td>\n<td>USPS 退款保证</td>\n<td>承诺日</td>\n<td>需保留寄件凭证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>证据包是追偿成败的关键。承运商只认自己体系内可核验的数据：轨迹号、扫描事件链、承诺时刻原文。平台应把「赔付工单」与「索赔单」建立一对一或一对多的关联，使一笔赔付能追溯到已追偿、部分追偿或放弃追偿三种结果之一，并让未追偿金额成为可监控的运营指标——它是纯粹漏损的成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;超时订单集合&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;按承运商 + 服务等级 + 周期分组&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;生成索赔单&lt;br/&gt;附轨迹证据包&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;提交承运商索赔入口&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;承运商裁决&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|接受| F[&quot;追偿到账&lt;br/&gt;冲抵赔付成本&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|部分接受| G[&quot;部分冲抵&lt;br/&gt;差额记漏损&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|拒绝| H[&quot;登记拒绝原因&lt;br/&gt;进入申诉或放弃&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; I[&quot;赔付准备金对账&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"超时订单集合\"] --&gt; B[\"按承运商 + 服务等级 + 周期分组\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"生成索赔单&lt;br/&gt;附轨迹证据包\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"提交承运商索赔入口\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"承运商裁决\"}\n    E --&gt;|接受| F[\"追偿到账&lt;br/&gt;冲抵赔付成本\"]\n    E --&gt;|部分接受| G[\"部分冲抵&lt;br/&gt;差额记漏损\"]\n    E --&gt;|拒绝| H[\"登记拒绝原因&lt;br/&gt;进入申诉或放弃\"]\n    F --&gt; I[\"赔付准备金对账\"]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"幂等-对账与异常处理\">幂等、对账与异常处理</h2><p>赔付是典型的<strong>恰一次</strong>要求场景：重复赔付比漏赔更伤利润，也更难被用户主动发现。所有赔付写入必须带业务幂等键——实践中用「订单号 + 权益类型 + 判定规则版本」三元组，落库前做唯一约束，重试命中冲突即视为已处理而非报错。</p>\n<p>对账是最后一个也是最重要的一道闸。它要回答三个问题：账上记的赔付与真实出账是否一致、追偿到账是否已冲抵、准备金余额与在途风险是否匹配。典型的差异来源有四类：第三方支付网关回调丢失导致的「已赔未记」、券核销延迟导致的「已发未销」、汇率折算时点不同导致的金额微差、以及承运商追偿跨期到账导致的时序错配。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类型</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重复赔付</td>\n<td>同幂等键写入两次</td>\n<td>唯一约束拦截 + 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已赔未记</td>\n<td>支付网关已出账，内部无记录</td>\n<td>日终对账补齐 + 反向补录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追偿跨期</td>\n<td>索赔在赔付次月到账</td>\n<td>按权责发生制冲抵对应期间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率折差</td>\n<td>折算金额与到账金额不符</td>\n<td>单独记汇兑损益，不混成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券过期未核销</td>\n<td>券到期作废</td>\n<td>冲回准备金，计入节省</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自动赔付触发与资金结算是一条六子句合取的流水线：超时判定只是入口，证据等级、下单时的品类资格、免责集合、反欺诈与收款状态每一道都可能把工单挡在放款前，任何一条未知都应「挂起」而非放行。额度模型在免运费、固定券、比例与动态四类之间取舍，核心是成本封顶与权益去重；结算链路要把赔付币种、记账币种与追偿币种三处汇率显式处理，并把未支付的或有负债按期望值计提准备金。承运商追偿把支出反向传导，按批次聚合、以可核验证据包提交，未追偿金额是必须监控的漏损。最后，幂等键与日终对账是这套机制的闸门——把「钱去哪了、为什么去、能不能追回」同时回答清楚，自动赔付才从营销承诺变成可控的财务流程。本节讨论的追偿成本与赔付率，最终会作为输入反向优化承诺参数，例如在超时率高的目的地适当放宽承诺日；承诺绩效（OTDR / DIFOT）与追偿漏损如何度量，属于「承诺绩效与转化」章节的范畴。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动赔付触发与资金结算机制","id":"自动赔付触发与资金结算机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：触发条件是合取式","id":"核心概念-触发条件是合取式"},{"level":2,"text":"赔付额度：阶梯、封顶与形式选择","id":"赔付额度-阶梯-封顶与形式选择"},{"level":2,"text":"资金结算的时序与出账链路","id":"资金结算的时序与出账链路"},{"level":2,"text":"承运商追偿：把支出反向传导","id":"承运商追偿-把支出反向传导"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等、对账与异常处理","id":"幂等-对账与异常处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"赔付规则与责任主体归属模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/auto-compensation-carrier-claim/compensation-liability-model"},"next":{"title":"承运商追偿与索赔申诉实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/guaranteed-delivery-sla-promise/auto-compensation-carrier-claim/carrier-claim-and-recovery"}}